1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,558
Most install guides for Claude Code are

2
00:00:02,598 --> 00:00:03,197
out of date.

3
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:04,397
Use this.

4
00:00:04,777 --> 00:00:05,357
One line.

5
00:00:05,557 --> 00:00:08,719
Mac, Linux, WSL — all

6
00:00:08,739 --> 00:00:09,359
the same.

7
00:00:09,503 --> 00:00:11,279
Pipe curl into bash.

8
00:00:11,382 --> 00:00:14,236
Claude Code installs in about thirty seconds.

9
00:00:14,423 --> 00:00:15,597
No npm.

10
00:00:15,784 --> 00:00:17,116
No Node required.

11
00:00:17,636 --> 00:00:19,036
Now type claude.

12
00:00:19,146 --> 00:00:20,476
Browser opens.

13
00:00:20,636 --> 00:00:23,355
Sign in with your Anthropic account —

14
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:26,316
Pro, Team, or Console — and that's

15
00:00:26,369 --> 00:00:26,635
it.

16
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:29,035
No API keys to wrangle.

17
00:00:29,115 --> 00:00:29,837
You're in.

18
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:33,195
The native installer auto-updates in the background.

19
00:00:33,323 --> 00:00:35,915
That's the real upgrade over npm.

20
00:00:36,075 --> 00:00:38,475
One command, zero deps.

21
00:00:38,595 --> 00:00:41,277
Heads up — Windows users still need

22
00:00:41,337 --> 00:00:42,877
